04:11:31.587 --> 04:11:36.621
<v Clips>toxic content, exploiting children, creating dangers for them.

04:11:37.843 --> 04:11:42.946
<v Clips>And Senator Blackburn and I and others like Senator Durbin on the Judiciary

04:11:42.946 --> 04:11:46.829
<v Clips>Committee are trying to deal with it, Kids Online Safety Act.

04:11:47.130 --> 04:11:50.173
<v Clips>But Congress failed to meet the moment on social media.

04:11:50.394 --> 04:11:56.041
<v Clips>Jetzt haben wir die Verpflichtung, das an AI zu tun, bevor die Bedrohungen und

04:11:56.041 --> 04:11:57.682
<v Clips>die Risiken wirklich wahr werden.

04:11:59.070 --> 04:12:03.153
<v Stefan>So, bei Social Media hat man den Moment verpasst. Das darf uns nicht noch mal

